scene every-command

// ═══════════════════ EVERY COMMAND, ONCE ═══════════════════
// A witness example, not a genre guide. The twelve genre examples cover the
// commands a story reaches for daily; this one exercises what they never touch
// (save/load, wait, tint/blur, preload, text_pace, named animations, splines,
// queued lanes, stat-gated options) so that CAPABILITIES.md can not document a
// construct nothing compiles. The doc gate (tools/lvnconv/lvn/
// docs_contract_test.go) fails when a documented construct has no witness in
// howto/ or examples/ — this file is where the leftovers get their witness.
//
// It is still a real scene: a projectionist threads reel three and the machine
// argues back.

actor_map Ida=ida

// ─── `include "<path>"` вклеивает другой .lvns НА ЭТАПЕ СБОРКИ: метки и
//     функции оттуда становятся частью этой главы, а рантайм о файле не
//     узнаёт. Так выносят общее — концовки, повторяющуюся сцену, стандартные
//     реакции героя. Механизм работал, был описан в docs/packages.md для
//     разработчиков движка — и ни слова в howto/, куда смотрит автор.
// (сама вклейка стоит в КОНЦЕ файла — см. ниже: вклеенные метки не должны
//  играться линейно, до них добираются переходом)

// ─── Typing speed for the whole scene (chars/sec; 0 = instant) ───
text_pace cps=45

// ─── Voice-over: `voice <url>` voices the NEXT line and mutes itself on the
//     one after. Documented in CAPABILITIES (the `voice?` field of `say`) and
//     implemented in both compilers and the player — yet no example compiled
//     into it, because the doc gate checks OPS and this one is a prefix.
voice "/content/audio/ec/hit.ogg"
Ida: Слышишь? Плёнка идёт с голосом.
if reel_ok == 0 -> reel_burned

// ─── `ext <op> k=v` — единственная дверь к операции, которой у движка нет:
//     игра регистрирует её сама (LvnOps.Register). Документирована как
//     escape hatch, и до сих пор не имела примера — а именно она решает,
//     можно ли расширить язык, не меняя движок.
ext wallet_earn currency=gold amount=1 reason="reel_threaded"

// ─── Warm the assets the scene is about to need (non-blocking) ───
preload url="/content/bg/projection.jpg" kind=sprite
preload url="/content/sfx/projector.ogg" kind=audio

// Full-frame multi-effect stack (Canvas path). Sticky fields; off resets.
fx vignette=0.35 grain=0.12
fx frost=0.5 blink=0.3 invert=0.2 dur=0.4
fx fog=0.5 rain=0.7 embers=0.4
fx blood=0.8 poison=0.5 speedlines=0.7
fx shockwave=1 shock_x=0.5 shock_y=0.45 dur=0.5
fx space=0.9 space_x=0.5 space_y=0.42 space_radius=0.28 space_color=#9148ff
fx dream=0.7 sepia=0.4 posterize=0.3 letterbox=0.6
fx off

// Per-actor sprite effects (Canvas path).
sfx id=mara outline=0.6 outline_color=#ffd76a
sfx id=mara flash=0.8 dark=0.5 tint=0.6 tint_color=#7ad0ff dur=0.1
sfx id=mara dissolve=1 dur=1.5
sfx id=mara ghost=0.8 rim=0.5 shake=0.12
sfx id=mara petrify=1 hologram=0.7 burn=0.5
sfx id=mara aura=0.9 aura_style=guard aura_color=#72d9ff aura_color2=#a95fff lightning=0.35
sfx id=mara aura=0.9 aura_style=fire
sfx id=mara aura=0.9 aura_style=frost
sfx id=mara aura=1 aura_style=space
sfx id=mara aura=1 aura_style=distortion
sfx id=mara aura=1 aura_style=spirit aura_color=#3657ff aura_color2=#d8fbff
sfx id=mara aura=1 aura_style=ascendant aura_color=#1748ff aura_color2=#d8f7ff aura_size=1.25 aura_speed=0.8 aura_density=1.4
sfx id=mara part=weapon blade=1 blade_color=#d7f8ff runes=0.45 runes_color=#ffc963
sfx id=mara off

bg /content/bg/projection.jpg
bg3d id=apartment fov=55
bg3d x=1.2 y=1.6 z=-3 pitch=-8 yaw=45 dur=1.2
bg3d live=1
bg3d off
actor ida left neutral scale=1 rotation=0
Ida: Reel three. Let's see if the lamp holds this time.

// ─── Snapshot: the "watch it again" option below rewinds to exactly here ───
save slot="booth"

// ─── A warm veil plus a blur = the beam coming up ───
tint color="#f0c070" alpha=0.25 duration=0.6
blur alpha=0.35 duration=0.5
wait ms=400
The beam catches the dust in the air.
blur alpha=0 duration=0.4

// ─── Портал: СЛОЙ сцены, а не эффект кадра ───
// Створ рисуется между фоном и актёрами — поэтому Ида стоит ПЕРЕД ним, и он
// может её забрать. Постэффекту такое не под силу: он живёт на камере и
// работает с кадром, где она уже нарисована.
portal open=0.3 x=0.72 y=0.52 radius=0.28 color="#7ad7ff" dur=0.5
The air folds where the light thickens.
portal open=1 dur=0.7
portal open=0 dur=0.8

// ─── Animation: one property per lane, so these three play at once ───
anim id=ida prop=rotation keys="0:-3 1:3 2:-3" loop=yoyo ease=inOutSine
anim ida scale to=1.04 dur=0.6 ease=outBack
anim ida alpha to=0.85 dur=0.4 ease=linear   // the house lights drop on her

// ─── A named animation: defined once (emits nothing), stamped on anybody ───
defanim rattle prop=x keys="0:0 0.05:-0.02 0.1:0.02 0.15:0" loop=restart
play id=ida anim=rattle
Ida: Hear that? The film gate is rattling again.
anim ida stop

// ─── One lane, in order: mode=queue waits for the step before it ───
anim id=ida channel=pace prop=screen_x to=0.34 dur=0.8 ease=outCubic
anim id=ida channel=pace prop=screen_x to=0.20 dur=0.8 ease=inBack mode=queue

// ─── A path: spline through the waypoints, nose along the tangent ───
move id=ida path="0.20,0.62 0.50,0.55 0.78,0.62" dur=1.6 interp=spline orient=true ease=outCubic
wait ms=200

// ─── Squash and stretch: two axes, one of them stepped (values snap) ───
anim id=ida prop=scalex keys="0:1 0.2:1.06 0.4:1" ease=inOutSine loop=once
anim id=ida prop=scaley keys="0:1 0.2:0.94 0.4:1" interp=step loop=once
Ida: There. Threaded.

// ─── A stat gate on an option: too low, and the option is HIDDEN ───
// (`requires_stat` + `min` hide it — they do not grey it out.)
lamp = 2
Ida: The lamp is at {lamp} of 3. What do we do?

// An option's `{ … }` BODY runs on pick, before the jump: the place for the
// "ask this once" flag or a stat bump. The brace ends the option line, the `}`
// stands alone, and the block is flat (no `if`/`choice` inside).
//
// Keep a body to set/inc/goto. A body command has no index in the script, and
// the resume trace is a list of indices — so anything in a body that touches
// the STAGE plays once and is gone the moment a save is restored. Staging goes
// after the label, like the `hint` below.
- Push the lamp to full -> forced requires_stat=lamp min=3
- Thread it by hand and run it soft -> soft {
    lamp = lamp + 1
}
- Rewind and watch the reel again -> again

:forced
// Unreachable while lamp < 3 — that is the point of the gate.
Ida: Full power. Bold.
-> reel

:soft
hint text="The soft run costs you a notch of light."

// track — метка конверсии. В кадре не делает НИЧЕГО и намеренно: её работа
// попасть в отчёт «важные места». Ставится там, где хочется МЕРИТЬ, а не там,
// где нужен переход — обычные метки для этого не годятся, их имена в
// импортированной главе выглядят как n26_000000.
track "прошёл развилку света"
Ida: Soft it is. The audience will never know.
-> reel

:again
// `load` restores the snapshot and redraws the scene from that point.
load slot="booth"
-> reel

:reel
tint color="#f0c070" alpha=0 duration=0.5
wait ms=300
The reel runs out. The house lights come up.

// ─── WEAVE: prose inside the branches, converging on its own ───
// The same `{ … }` block as above — the compiler reads what is inside and picks
// the mechanism. `set`/`inc`/`goto` stays a runtime body; prose is lowered into
// script behind a minted label. Both branches land on the line after the choice,
// so this costs zero invented names. Written the old way it is three labels
// (two branches + one convergence) and three jumps.
Ida: Do we tell the projectionist about the gate?
- Tell her {
    Ida: Better she hears it from us.
    lamp = lamp + 1
}
- Say nothing {
    Ida: She has enough to carry tonight.
}
Ida: Either way, the reel is done.

// ─── One command empties the stage: `clear` takes every actor and obj off ───
// The background stays — that is the whole point, a scene change is `clear`
// plus a new `bg` and never an accidental black screen. Without it this line
// is one `actor … show=false` per body on stage, and a bug the day somebody
// new walks into the scene and nobody updates the list.
clear

// ─── `cutscene` takes the interface away for a frame that is pure picture ───
// Dialogue, choices, HUD labels, quick menu and every `ui` tree go at once,
// and the camera may push in. It is a STATE, not an effect: `off=1` puts it
// all back and resets the camera. The same switch the long-press art view
// uses — the author reaches it with an op, the player with a gesture.
cutscene on=1 zoom=1.12 dur=2
wait ms=300
cutscene off=1

The booth is empty. Only the projector is still warm.
-> __end

// Вклейка стоит ПОСЛЕ финала намеренно: `include` вставляет содержимое туда,
// где написан, и вклеенная в начале концовка играла свою реплику до того, как
// игрок что-либо сделал, а потом ловила поток в петлю. Вклеенные метки —
// цель переходов, а не часть линейного текста.
include "endings.lvns"
